" data-tex=\"L\\in V\">\\(L\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_L\\in V\">\\(\\leq_L\\in V\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_L\\in V\">\\(1_L\\in V\\)</span> (lottery-sum carrier, order, and new top)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\)</span> (forcing-poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10LotterySumForcing}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10LotterySumForcing}_S\\)</span> (lottery-sum predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}lottery\\text{-}sum\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10LotterySumForcing}_S(L,\\leq_L,1_L,\\mathcal P,\\vec{\\leq},\\vec 1)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists A,B\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\leq},\\mathcal P,A)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec1,\\mathcal P,B)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall P\\in\\mathcal P\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\vec{\\leq}(P),\\vec 1(P))\\bigr)\\land\n1_L\\notin\\{\\langle P,p\\rangle:P\\in\\mathcal P\\land p\\in P\\}\\land\nL=\\{1_L\\}\\cup\\{\\langle P,p\\rangle:P\\in\\mathcal P\\land p\\in P\\}\\land\n\\leq_L\\subseteq L\\times L\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in L\\;\\Bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq_L\\leftrightarrow\ny=1_L\\lor\\exists P\\in\\mathcal P\\;\\exists p,q\\in P\\;\n(x=\\langle P,p\\rangle\\land y=\\langle P,q\\rangle\\land\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in\\vec{\\leq}(P))\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}lottery\\text{-}sum\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10LotterySumForcing}_S(L,\\leq_L,1_L,\\mathcal P,\\vec{\\leq},\\vec 1)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists A,B\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\leq},\\mathcal P,A)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec1,\\mathcal P,B)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall P\\in\\mathcal P\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\vec{\\leq}(P),\\vec 1(P))\\bigr)\\land\n1_L\\notin\\{\\langle P,p\\rangle:P\\in\\mathcal P\\land p\\in P\\}\\land\nL=\\{1_L\\}\\cup\\{\\langle P,p\\rangle:P\\in\\mathcal P\\land p\\in P\\}\\land\n\\leq_L\\subseteq L\\times L\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in L\\;\\Bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq_L\\leftrightarrow\ny=1_L\\lor\\exists P\\in\\mathcal P\\;\\exists p,q\\in P\\;\n(x=\\langle P,p\\rangle\\land y=\\langle P,q\\rangle\\land\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in\\vec{\\leq}(P))\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary forcing construction definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function"